  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>The heat your body generates can set others aflame.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Inner Flame<sup>ARG</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Your bonus on saves against fire attacks and spells with the fire or light descriptors increases to +6. When you use Scorching Weapons or grappling, targets that take fire damage from your attacks or successful grapple checks must succeed at a Reflex save or catch on fire (DC = 10 + 1/2 your level + your Con modifier). This fire does not harm you even if you are grappling a burning creature.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-combat-a-m-feats#toc194\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
